{"symbol":"NANTA","yahoo":"NANTA.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Nanta Tech Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","website":"https://www.nantatech.com","about":"Nanta Tech Limited engages in supplying, installation, testing, and commissioning of audio visual (AV), service robots, and IT network solutions in India. The company offers AV integrations end-to-end audio-visual systems for control rooms, auditoriums, hospitals, boardrooms, and public spaces; and service robots, including AI receptionist, humanoid, dog, cleaning, serving, and autonomous mobile robots, as well as cobot, a collaborative robot. It also provides AV products, such as A Type standee; active LED portable standee; indoor LED digital signages; and interactive panels, business webcam, PTZ camera, digital array microphone, video bar, and smart conferencing speakerphone. In addition, the company offers AI services comprising AI automation, computer vision, AI chatbots, web development, robotics integration, generative AI, data and analytics, and cloud and infrastructure. Nanta Tech Limited was incorporated in 2023 and is based in Ahmedabad, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:42:56+00:00","quote":{"price":369.9,"prevClose":360.55,"marketCap":189.76,"high52":651.4,"low52":234.0,"pe":18.32,"bookValue":97.42,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":25.47,"shares":0.513,"insiders":83.97,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-12-31","2026-01-01","2026-01-02","2026-01-05","2026-01-06","2026-01-07","2026-01-08","2026-01-09","2026-01-12","2026-01-13","2026-01-14","2026-01-16","2026-01-19","2026-01-20","2026-01-21","2026-01-22","2026-01-23","2026-01-27","2026-01-28","2026-01-29","2026-01-30","2026-02-02","2026-02-03","2026-02-04","2026-02-05","2026-02-06","2026-02-09","2026-02-10","2026-02-11","2026-02-12","2026-02-13","2026-02-16","2026-02-17","2026-02-18","2026-02-19","2026-02-20","2026-02-23","2026-02-24","2026-02-25","2026-02-26","2026-02-27","2026-03-02","2026-03-04","2026-03-0